  "term": "cortical neuron",
  "definition": "A cortical neuron is a neuron studied as part of networks grown in culture that can show spontaneous spiking and bursting activity. In this source, cortical neurons are discussed for their intrinsic properties and for how their network activity changes under radiofrequency exposure or muscimol.",
